{"parentUuid":"7450cf84-5112-49e9-aecc-25da91344c77","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpoVpGJujzeqs6HZoscV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Upcoming resets is now a timeline, and it keeps the time left. Each row shows the countdown on the left, a dot on a connecting line, then the exact reset time and the account, with the provider and window underneath, for example:\n- 30m · **6:52 PM** · aravind@21n.co — ChatGPT · 5-hour usage\n- 1h 17m · **7:40 PM** · Serro — Claude · 5-hour usage\n- 2h 57m · **9:20 PM** · dev@21n.co — Claude · 5-hour usage\n\n- **Time format:** resets later today show just the time; later days add the weekday, for example \"Fri 9:07 AM\".\n- **Dots:** the soonest reset has a filled dot, and the rest are outlined.\n- **Unchanged:** hovering still shows the full date, and clicking a row still jumps to that account's card.\n\nAfter the screenshot I made the connecting line longer to close the small gaps between rows, but I haven't looked at it since. The build passes, and a reload of the running preview shows it. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":543,"cache_read_input_tokens":913232,"output_tokens":349,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":543,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":913232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":543,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":543},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfpoVoknoBuGzkSE2g3x2","type":"