{"parentUuid":"0e6d2ea3-771e-4084-a376-d0659db9da19","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfpom7urvUWTocmaxXySm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both are fixed, and I checked them in the browser on the running preview.\n\n- **Timeline:** it's now one continuous line from the first dot to the last, sitting behind the dots. The old per-row segments were the problem: each row's piece could be covered by the next row, which left gaps.\n  - The line is measured from the dot positions after layout, and re-measured whenever the card resizes.\n  - In the browser it lines up with the dots' centres exactly.\n  - Adding the line also broke the filled first dot, so I fixed that too.\n- **Heatmap:** the tiles now fill the Activity card's height. The card matches its row's height, and each of the four rows takes an equal share, never shrinking below 10px. Right now the tiles are about 27px tall, up from a fixed 12px, so the heatmap no longer leaves empty space at the bottom.\n\nThe checks and build pass. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3427,"cache_read_input_tokens":929923,"output_tokens":356,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":64},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3427,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":929923,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3427,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3427},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfpom7MdcjFHCQHNnYi9G","type":"assistant","uuid":"75ba99f7-57f8-4354-822