{"parentUuid":"c542d8d7-0ddd-4b4b-a56b-a901d4f0b6bb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"54454a4d-12b9-4ee3-b2a6-9023849a1ade","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GMEFKqsKHPZXbMtgfMpYoi","type":"tool_result","content":"Connect AI agents to external tools. \u001b[1msearch\u001b[22m, \u001b[1mexecute\u001b[22m, \u001b[1mlink\u001b[22m, \u001b[1mproxy\u001b[22m, and \u001b[1mrun\u001b[22m let you\nTry \u001b[1mexecute\u001b[22m sooner than you'd think — it validates inputs, checks connections, and tells\nplayground execution, logs, and developer-scoped management commands.\n    Find tools by use case across all toolkits/apps.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio search <query...> [--toolkits text] [--limit integer] [--human]\n      \u001b[2m--toolkits          \u001b[22mFilter by toolkit slugs, comma-separated\n  \u001b[1mexecute\u001b[22m\n    Execute a tool. Validates inputs and connections automatically; use it aggressively.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio execute <slug> [-d, --data text] [--account selector] [--file path] [--dry-run] [--get-schema] | execute -p <slug> -d <text> <slug> -d <text> ...\n      \u001b[2m<slug>              \u001b[22mTool slug (e.g. \"GITHUB_CREATE_ISSUE\")\n      \u001b[2m-p, --parallel      \u001b[22mExecute repeated <slug> -d <text> pairs concurrently\n      \u001b[2m--dry-run           \u001b[22mValidate and preview the tool call without executing it\n    Connect your account for a toolkit/app.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio link [<toolkit>] [--alias text]\n      \u001b[2m<toolkit>           \u001b[22mToolkit slug to link (e.g. \"github\", \"gmail\")\n  \u001b[1mrun\u001b[22m\n    Run inline TS/JS code with shimmed CLI commands; injected execute(), search(), proxy(), experimental_subAgent(), and z (zod).\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio run <code> [-- ...args] | run [-f, --file text] [-- ...args] [--dry-run]\n      \u001b[2m-f, --file          \u001b[22mRun a TS/JS file instead of inline code\n      \u001b[2m--dry-run           \u001b[22mPreview execute() calls without running remote actions\n    curl-like access to any toolkit API through Composio using your connected account.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio proxy <url> --toolkit text [--account selector] [-X method] [-H header]... [-d data]\n      \u001b[2m--toolkit           \u001b[22mToolkit slug whose connected account should be used\n\u001b[90m  Typical flow: search → execute (link and tools when needed)\u001b[39m","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"69c27b67-2d03-4174-ba98-70be1148bd88","timestamp":"2026-10-08T13:23:20.381Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Connect AI agents to external tools. \u001b[1msearch\u001b[22m, \u001b[1mexecute\u001b[22m, \u001b[1mlink\u001b[22m, \u001b[1mproxy\u001b[22m, and \u001b[1mrun\u001b[22m let you\nTry \u001b[1mexecute\u001b[22m sooner than you'd think — it validates inputs, checks connections, and tells\nplayground execution, logs, and developer-scoped management commands.\n    Find tools by use case across all toolkits/apps.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio search <query...> [--toolkits text] [--limit integer] [--human]\n      \u001b[2m--toolkits          \u001b[22mFilter by toolkit slugs, comma-separated\n  \u001b[1mexecute\u001b[22m\n    Execute a tool. Validates inputs and connections automatically; use it aggressively.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio execute <slug> [-d, --data text] [--account selector] [--file path] [--dry-run] [--get-schema] | execute -p <slug> -d <text> <slug> -d <text> ...\n      \u001b[2m<slug>              \u001b[22mTool slug (e.g. \"GITHUB_CREATE_ISSUE\")\n      \u001b[2m-p, --parallel      \u001b[22mExecute repeated <slug> -d <text> pairs concurrently\n      \u001b[2m--dry-run           \u001b[22mValidate and preview the tool call without executing it\n    Connect your account for a toolkit/app.\n    \u001b[2mUsage:\u001b[22m composio link [<toolkit>] [--alias text]\n      \u001b[2m<toolkit>           \u0