{"parentUuid":"8311b4b5-c8dd-46d8-ab2b-2a06246815ea","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"54454a4d-12b9-4ee3-b2a6-9023849a1ade","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R2TLxiaytZd87zc2kTxWny","type":"tool_result","content":"[('On Hold', 'started', '9ce4579f-4201-4f25-a0c4-96a568bd7a40'), ('Live', 'completed', '0fa73922-257f-4fa0-b4fd-17c640414a0f'), ('Watch', 'completed', '391defdb-3449-469c-9400-06b9850e101f'), ('Capturing', 'started', '7e0cfd7c-1729-4bba-b558-cae8eef7e8a4'), ('Inbox', 'backlog', 'fee095ce-f5be-4136-90b7-f06f13fb391d'), ('In Progress', 'started', 'f125b437-253b-4b2a-9c13-5a6da10a088c'), ('Canceled', 'canceled', 'd0f4f061-fe03-4e17-87aa-0be4e287c502'), ('Backlog', 'backlog', '9d5a2319-51e8-492d-b293-5595073d38f2'), ('Todo', 'unstarted', '93d3e405-b7e1-4800-91fc-e92ff179e4d1'), ('Done', 'completed', '8ea437ff-54ae-4711-9596-c4a3864c26ee'), ('Duplicate', 'duplicate', '78c412bb-efc7-4cf6-b267-9cf81ae65598'), ('In Review', 'started', '5123ae7e-f2dd-4480-85a7-b7f09703bae0')]\n## Outcome\n\nA user launches a standalone M Graph development build and grants or denies Accessibility access. Prove a native collector can read useful foreground context in representative browser and desktop apps, report missing or revoked permission, and run from a signed self-contained bundle without a separately installed runtime.\n\n## Scope\n\nSwift Accessibility collector and signed, self-contained packaging spike. Use the completed NPX-31 proof of concept as evidence only; graph inference and public release are excluded.\n\n## Acceptance evidence\n\nRecord app-by-app text quality and source identity, permission and revocation behavior, sandbox/signing constraints, bundle startup/shutdown, and a repeatable native integration check. Document the viable packaging route and any unsupported apps. Static compilation alone is insufficient.\n\n## Verification\n\nRun native integration checks on a macOS host. Record foreground text quality and source identity by app, grant/deny/revocation behavior, signing/sandbox constraints, startup/shutdown, and unsupported apps. A static build alone is insufficient.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nNo child prerequisite. This proof blocks SET-7.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"07f43b84-7310-453f-b035-a9372313ba52","timestamp":"2026-10-08T13:25:53.116Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"[('On Hold', 'started', '9ce4579f-4201-4f25-a0c4-96a568bd7a40'), ('Live', 'completed', '0fa73922-257f-4fa0-b4fd-17c640414a0f'), ('Watch', 'completed', '391defdb-3449-469c-9400-06b9850e101f'), ('Capturing', 'started', '7e0cfd7c-1729-4bba-b558-cae8eef7e8a4'), ('Inbox', 'backlog', 'fee095ce-f5be-4136-90b7-f06f13fb391d'), ('In Progress', 'started', 'f125b437-253b-4b2a-9c13-5a6da10a088c'), ('Canceled', 'canceled', 'd0f4f061-fe03-4e17-87aa-0be4e287c502'), ('Backlog', 'backlog', '9d5a2319-51e8-492d-b293-5595073d38f2'), ('Todo', 'unstarted', '93d3e405-b7e1-4800-91fc-e92ff179e4d1'), ('Done', 'completed', '8ea437ff-54ae-4711-9596-c4a3864c26ee'), ('Duplicate', 'duplicate', '78c412bb-efc7-4cf6-b267-9cf81ae65598'), ('In Review', 'started', '5123ae7e-f2dd-4480-85a7-b7f09703bae0')]\n## Outcome\n\nA user launches a standalone M Graph development build and grants or denies Accessibility access. Prove a native collector can read useful foreground context in representative browser and desktop apps, report missing or revoked permission, and run from a signed self-contained bundle without a separately installed runtime.\n\n## Scope\n\nSwift Accessibility collector and signed, self-contained packaging spike. Use the completed NPX-31 proof of concept as evidence only; graph inference and public release are excluded.\n\n## Acceptance evidence\n\nRecord app-by-app text quality and source identity, permission and revocation behavior, sandbox/signing constraints, bundle startup/shutdown, and a repeatable native integration check. Document the viable packaging route and any unsupported apps. Static compilation alone is insufficient.\n\n## Verification\n\nRun native integration checks on a macOS host. Record foreground text quality and source identity by app, grant/deny/revocation behavior, signing/sandbox constraints, startup/shutdown, and unsupported apps. A static build alone is insufficient.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nNo child prerequisite. This proof blocks SET-7.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8311b4b5-c8dd-46d8-ab2b-2a06246815ea","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset","sessionId":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"main","slug":"declarative-hopping-teapot"}
