{"parentUuid":"a5dd5349-36f5-4328-aafc-e73d489df29c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpwhtyLMyyDWVvL3jhdV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FahaJLCY9agWuae9mKJVzb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFix PR #6 review findings for the usage dashboard and CLI\n\nDashboard correctness:\n- Key reset and alert rows by window identity; title Claude model windows (also via\n  harnesses) from their labels, so duplicate titles no longer crash the dashboard.\n- Match harness logins to direct ChatGPT accounts by workspace ID from Codex\n  account/read; the ID stays host-internal.\n- Text fallback includes balances; snapshot vs live is decided by source; remaining-only\n  windows rank; \"Starts on first use\" is Factory-only; DST-safe activity days.\n\nProvider readers:\n- Codex reset settles on spawn errors/timeouts and never redeems after a failed read;\n  earliest expiry ignores redeemed credits.\n- Bounded streaming in fetchJson, HTTP-date Retry-After, Factory Retry-After.\n- OpenCode API keys are not subscriptions; re-login precedes unreadable; incomplete\n  ChatGPT windows are partial; Cursor $0 spend and unreadable state fixed.\n- Prototype-safe history and Antigravity spans; truncation flag; label bounds.\n\nCLI, scripts, and release:\n- Settings writes follow symlinks; removal keeps accounts whose collector can't be\n  restored; in-flight read dedupe; atomic identity file; platform shell for chaining.\n- Stricter SVG sanitizer, unique release slugs, no public-to-workspace deps,\n  prerelease dist-tag, npm ci --ignore-scripts, prepack rebuild, Node 22 floor.\n- UI: clear stale login choice, empty-state guard, undocumented-endpoint disclosure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push 2>&1 | tail -1; git rev-parse HEAD; git rev-parse origin/usage-dashboard-cli; GH_TOKEN=\"$(gh auth token --user thyaravind)\" gh pr view 6 --repo 21nCo/subset --json headRefOid -q .headRefOid","description":"Commit once, push once, verify SHAs","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":280,"cache_read_input_tokens":406018,"output_tokens":848,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":280,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":848,"cache_read_input_tokens":406018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":280},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FahaJLCY9agWuae9mKJVzb":{"command":"cd /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFix PR #6 review findings for the usage dashboard and CLI\n\nDashboard correctness:\n- Key reset and alert rows by window identity; title Claude model windows (also via\n  harnesses) from their labels, so duplicate titles no longer crash the dashboard.\n- Match harness logins to direct ChatGPT accounts by workspace ID from Codex\n  account/read; the ID stays host-internal.\n- Text fallback includes balances; snapshot vs live is decided by source; remaining-only\n  windows rank; \"Starts on first use\" is Factory-only; DST-safe activity days.\n\nProvider readers:\n- Codex reset settles on spawn errors/timeouts and never redeems after a failed read;\n  earliest expiry ignores redeemed credits.\n- Bounded streaming in fetchJson, HTTP-date Retry-After, Factory Retry-After.\n- OpenCode API keys are not subscriptions; re-login precedes unreadable; incomplete\n  ChatGPT windows are partial; Cursor $0 spend and unreadable state fixed.\n- Prototype-safe history and Antigravity spans; truncation flag; label bounds.\n\nCLI, scripts, and release:\n- Settings writes follow symlinks; removal keeps accounts whose collector can't be\n  restored; in-flight read dedupe; atomic identity file; platform shell for chaining.\n- Stricter SVG sanitizer, unique release slugs, no public-to-workspace deps,\n  prerelease dist-tag, npm ci --ignore-scripts, prepack rebuild, Node 22 floor.\n- UI: clear stale login choice, empty-state guard, undocumented-endpoint disclosure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push 2>&1 | tail -1; git rev-parse HEAD; git rev-parse origin/usage-dashboard-cli; GH_TOKEN=\"$(gh auth token --user thyaravind)\" gh pr view 6 --repo 21nCo/subset --json headRefOid -q .headRefOid","description":"Commit once, push once, verify SHAs","timeout":120000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01FahaJLCY9agWuae9mKJVzb":{"cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfpwhtYo86Nu1EPQDX6u7","attributionSkill":"use-skillplane","type":"assistant","uuid":"32e9714f-8010-4f1c-9517-d71d30bdff08","timestamp":"2026-10-08T14:40:51.628Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset","sessionId":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"usage-dashboard-cli","slug":"declarative-hopping-teapot"}
