{"parentUuid":"464412a9-2fdc-4fac-a770-0ec0950e9117","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfqBLdCbs5VKRqgeeV6BW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round found two new review comments: I fixed one and judged the other invalid. One fix commit, `6ae3c9d`, is pushed to https://github.com/21nCo/subset/pull/6. Local and remote match; the PR page still showed the previous commit when I checked once afterwards.\n\n**Snapshot:** at `312c4ba`, 15 review threads were still open: 2 new and 13 left over from earlier rounds. Checks were green, including SonarCloud; Socket Security was again neutral (scan skipped).\n\n**Fixed:**\n- **Agent results (N13):** `agentUsageResult` (`packages/usage/src/index.ts`) now also drops `retryAfterMs`, so rate-limit timing hints can't reach an agent even if a host forgets to strip them. The test asserts it, fails against the previous build and passes now.\n\n**Already handled (13 open threads):**\n- 7 were fixed in earlier rounds:\n  - Bucket truncation flag (round 2).\n  - Workspace matching.\n  - Windows Cursor and Windows shell.\n  - The two Node-version threads.\n  - One Node-version thread is outdated.\n- 4 I still consider invalid:\n  - The two `claude auth status` threads (CodeRabbit and cubic).\n  - Amp in the AGENTS.md exception.\n  - Keeping last good values on errors.\n- 2 not attempted, as before:\n  - Locking profile writes across two dashboard servers.\n  - Tolerating Cursor team member-count drift.\n- One more cubic thread (the Cursor redirect error code) is open and also unchanged from my earlier invalid call; I counted it with the 13 but it doesn't fit the tally above.\n\n**Invalid:**\n- **Node version for `@sub-set/usage` (N14):** the package's `engines >=22` describes what the installed CLI needs to run, which is Node 22. Only building and packing need Node 22.12+ (because of rolldown), and that happens in the workspace, whose root `engines` already requires 22.12. Raising the package's floor would turn away users on Node 22.0–22.11 for no runtime reason.\n\n**Verification:**\n- `npm run check`, `npm run build` and all tests pass (109 library, 40 CLI).\n- CI and the bot reviews on `6ae3c9d` haven't been checked.\n\n**Convergence:** improving — 21 valid problems in round 2, 1 this round, none left open. No fix introduced a regression this time, and no problem area has reached the skill's two-failed-rounds limit. No threads were replied to or resolved.\n\nOne review round is complete. No post-push refetch or additional review loop was performed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":700,"cache_read_input_tokens":461655,"output_tokens":879,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":700,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":879,"cache_read_input_tokens":461655,"cache_creation_input_tokens":700,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":700},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfqBLcq2cbtx6h2py9yaS","attributionSkill":"use-skillplane","type":"assistant","uuid":"b93d754e-3b9e-48f4-bdb1-66a5ef3d040b","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:39:39.823Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset","sessionId":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"usage-dashboard-cli","slug":"declarative-hopping-teapot"}
