{"parentUuid":"e0bccc9f-a8c0-4712-a29d-44ef58e5161e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"774299d2-e204-4d30-a257-a813b2b28e44","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FmaqZTKK3eTmcwoxSnWMzg","type":"tool_result","content":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/logos3\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/logos2\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/factory-logo\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/logos.bak\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/icons/iconify-json-logos-1.2.15.tgz\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/icons/iconify-json-logos-1.2.15\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ffb64677-c2a8-46b5-8e0d-802e08e3f079.jsonl:\"text\":\"I've started a high-effort review of all uncommitted changes. It covers the edits to `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, the directory app, the catalog and the package f\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe.jsonl:\"text\":\"The OpenAI and Cursor logos are near-black, so the generator will switch them to `currentColor` so they stay visible in dark mode. Writing the generator:\"\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe.jsonl:\"text\":\"Next, the view: the Default tag beside the name, status pills moved to the footer (and hidden when up to date), names falling back to email, the trend setting, and bare logos in the f\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe.jsonl:\"text\":\"The OpenCode logo's dark fill now follows the text colour, and Devin's monochrome mark is wrapped to do the same. I'll check how Synara parses OpenCode Go's usage response before writ\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe.jsonl:\"text\":\"Most of these are layout fixes. Two need research first: what Cursor's response contains beyond the one percentage, and the real Amp and Pi logos. (The \\\"\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe.jsonl:\"text\":\"That builds. Next, the logos for omp and Hermes. I'll check their sites for SVG favicons:\"\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe.jsonl:\"text\":\"Sanitizer verified (generated logos unchanged). Now the CLI server and accounts fixes.\"","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"be38a05b-5aea-4a02-ba8f-9868ec063994","timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:03:55.404Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/logos3\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/logos2\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/factory-logo\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/logos.bak\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/icons/iconify-json-logos-1.2.15.tgz\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe/scratchpad/icons/iconify-json-logos-1.2.15\n/Users/serro/.claude/projects/-Users-serro-Documents-dev-n-subset/ffb64677-c2a8-46b5-8e0d-802e08e3f079.jsonl:\"text\":\"I've started a high-effort review of all uncommitted changes. It covers the edits to