{"parentUuid":"2a132c52-5b18-4c14-a304-1d744ba1ae5a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfqJCuw27jkNQp2R1y4Mc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XgNmj2SxdYyBxCp5nQPgPG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset && python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        assert s.count(a)==1,(p,a[:70])\n        s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\nedit('packages/usage-cli/src/server.mjs',[(\"\"\"  // One account signed in to several harnesses gets one card: the direct ChatGPT or Claude\n  // account (or the first harness) is read, and the others are listed in `alsoIn`.\"\"\",\"\"\"  // One account signed in to several harnesses gets one card when its identity is proven: the\n  // direct ChatGPT or Claude account (or the first harness) is read, and the others are listed in `alsoIn`.\"\"\")])\nedit('packages/usage/README.md',[(\"\"\"- **Harness logins** (Pi, OpenCode, omp, Hermes) are grouped by email and ChatGPT workspace, and join a direct ChatGPT account only when the plans agree, so a Personal and a Team workspace under one email stay separate.\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Harness logins** (Pi, OpenCode, omp, Hermes) share a card with another login only when their identity is proven: for ChatGPT, the same email and the same ChatGPT workspace ID (from Codex `account/read` and the stored token), both known; for Claude, the same email. Plans are never used as proof, and a login with unknown identity keeps its own card, so Personal and Team workspaces under one email, or two Business workspaces on the same plan, stay separate.\"\"\")])\nEOF\ngrep -n \"Also in\" packages/usage/README.md | head -2; export GH_TOKEN=\"$(gh auth token --user thyaravind)\"; for r in actions/checkout:v4 actions/setup-node:v4; do repo=${r%%:*}; tag=${r##*:}; sha=$(gh api repos/$repo/commits/$tag -q .sha); echo \"$repo $tag $sha\"; done","description":"Up