{"parentUuid":"bc838f80-745b-4ceb-abde-2e880b114c72","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfqLwKGNLq2tyrdLVuVpz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed both new review comments this round, which were small hardening items on the release workflow, and pushed one commit, `2a9672a`, to https://github.com/21nCo/subset/pull/6. Local and remote match; the PR page still showed `09a0f5b` when I checked.\n\n**State before the round:** 15 unresolved threads, 2 of them new; the other 13 are the same ones from earlier rounds, unchanged. All checks were green (Socket Security neutral, as before). Pullfrog reviewed `09a0f5b` with no new issues, so the account-merging fix from last round holds.\n\n**Fixed (both in `.github/workflows/publish-tag.yml`):**\n- **Pinned action versions (cubic):** the comments next to the two pinned actions now say `v4.4.0` instead of `v4`. I checked with `git ls-remote` that both commit SHAs are exactly the `v4.4.0` tags of `actions/checkout` and `actions/setup-node`, so the pins themselves were already right.\n- **Checkout token (CodeRabbit):** the checkout step now sets `persist-credentials: false`. After checkout the job only runs local `git rev-parse`, so no step needs the token, and code from the tag can no longer read it from git config.\n\n**Verification:**\n- The workflow file parses and keeps the new checkout setting.\n- `npm run check`, `npm run build` and all tests pass (109 library, 41 CLI).\n- Not checked: the workflow itself on GitHub (it only runs when a `usage-v*` tag is pushed), CI on `2a9672a`, and the bots' re-reviews.\n\n**Convergence:** improving. Valid problems dropped from about 66 in round 1 to 21, 1, 2 and now 2 small workflow items, none left open. The account-merging issue that tripped the convergence limit last round is now confirmed closed. Nothing was deferred or found to be a regression. I updated the scratch ledger (`scratchpad/pr6/ledger.md`). No threads were replied to or resolved.\n\nOne review round is complete. No post-push refetch or additional review loop was performed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_read_input_tokens":497540,"output_tokens":701,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1802,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":497540,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1802},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfqLwJDceUKG2WDowp5UN","attributionSkill":"use-skillplane","type":"assistant","uuid":"5866bf1a-126e-490d-9343-1ae458bcdc0e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:45:29.908Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset","sessionId":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"usage-dashboard-cli","slug":"declarative-hopping-teapot"}
