{"parentUuid":"a58ca9ef-5e1b-4206-b4c0-1d524ecc955c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"369e8842-fbbb-450d-9fed-61941f2b2007","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/serro/.claude/skills/use-skillplane\n\n# Skillplane\n\nSkillplane is user's hosted skills platform. Retrieve user's skill using the slug or skill name provided and use that to execute the requested task.\n\nNOTE: Always retrieve and read the hosted skill first before working on the task. If the skill is not found, return an error message indicating the skill could not be located.\n\n## Using skillplane\nTry these in this order to communicate with user's Skillplane for skill retrieval, creation, amend etc.\n1. Direct Skillplane MCP if available and authenticated\n2. Direct Skillplane CLI if available and authenticated\n3. Via Composio CLI if available and authenticated\n4. Via Rex CLI if available and authenticated\n\n## Using tools mentioned in skillplane skills\nWhen executing a skill retrieved from Skillplane, use the tools referenced within the skill's definition to complete the task. Example tools: Linear, Notion, etc. Tool/Integrations resolution order:\n1. Direct integrations or MCP if available and authenticated\n2. Via Orca CLI if available and authenticated\n3. Via Composio CLI if available and authenticated\n4. Via Rex CLI if available and authenticated\n\n\nARGUMENTS: pr-refetch-fix"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"687eca6c-d6a6-4b14-b3a3-5c08f8239d91","timestamp":"2026-10-08T20:09:13.891Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset","sessionId":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"usage-dashboard-cli","slug":"declarative-hopping-teapot"}
