{"parentUuid":"50976f34-4858-43c9-82a3-d97ae0829e1d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfqNoH6uB3BiRBU2ojFv7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing new needed fixing this round, so I made no commit and no push. The PR is still at `2a9672a`: https://github.com/21nCo/subset/pull/6\n\n**What the round found:**\n- No new review threads; the two release-workflow threads from round 5 are now resolved.\n- Pullfrog reviewed `2a9672a` with no new issues, Kody found none, and SonarCloud's quality gate passed.\n- All checks are green except Socket Security, which is neutral as in every earlier round (its scan was skipped).\n\n**Still open: 13 threads.** All were already open in round 4, and the code they point at hasn't changed since I classified them:\n- **Already fixed but left open by the bots:**\n  - The 80-character label limit.\n  - The Antigravity bucket-cap flag.\n  - Windows support for personal Cursor and for the collector's shell.\n  - Two threads about the Node version floor.\n  - Matching harness logins by workspace, which pullfrog has now accepted.\n- **Invalid:**\n  - The two threads asking to drop the `claude auth status` check.\n  - Adding Amp to the AGENTS.md local sign-ins exception.\n  - Keeping the last good values when a read fails.\n  - The Cursor redirect error code.\n- **Not attempted:**\n  - Locking profile writes across two running dashboard servers.\n  - Tolerating Cursor team member-count drift mid-read.\n\nI didn't reply to or resolve any of them. If you want the fixed ones closed, or the invalid ones answered in their threads, ask and I'll do it.\n\n**Convergence:** improving. Valid problems per round went 66, 21, 1, 2, 2, and now 0, with none left open. Nothing is stuck past the skill's limits. I updated the scratch ledger (`scratchpad/pr6/ledger.md`).\n\n**Merge readiness:** the review bots have no remaining code findings. Whether to merge is your call, and merging doesn't publish anything. Not yet verified:\n- The publish workflow itself, which only runs when a `usage-v*` tag is pushed.\n- The npm package.\n- The first-run banner in a browser.\n\nOne review round is complete. No post-push refetch or additional review loop was performed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":550,"cache_read_input_tokens":503228,"output_tokens":736,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":550,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":736,"cache_read_input_tokens":503228,"cache_creation_input_tokens":550,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":550},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfqNoGiLeFvfQLHcYhkgB","attributionSkill":"use-skillplane","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c95106c-908b-4bc5-804c-820c27389b7f","timestamp":"2026-10-08T20:09:55.178Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset","sessionId":"ccf55d8d-6176-4456-a8a3-555947c35bfe","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"usage-dashboard-cli","slug":"declarative-hopping-teapot"}
