{"parentUuid":"d94b4c0c-6e98-4893-82e4-241ae5e84ba9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22ad81bd-ba29-4497-81fb-b78cf747c8f1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q6NCrsjDx28iJK9WR2pCj1","type":"tool_result","content":"Auto-merging docs/architecture.md\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in docs/architecture.md\nAuto-merging package-lock.json\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in package-lock.json\nAuto-merging package.json\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in package.json\nAuto-merging scripts/check-workspaces.mjs\nAutomatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.\nUU README.md\nUU docs/architecture.md\nUU package-lock.json\nUU package.json","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"03af91d7-9a87-414f-bd36-f0bef4e76864","timestamp":"2026-10-08T20:29:02.748Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Auto-merging docs/architecture.md\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in docs/architecture.md\nAuto-merging package-lock.json\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in package-lock.json\nAuto-merging package.json\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in package.json\nAuto-merging scripts/check-workspaces.mjs\nAutomatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.\nUU README.md\nUU docs/architecture.md\nUU package-lock.json\nUU package.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":37,"oldLines":7,"newStart":37,"newLines":11,"lines":[" "," ## Development"," ","+<<<<<<< HEAD"," Requires Node.js 22.12 or newer and npm 10.","+=======","+Requires Node.js 22.13 or newer and npm 10.","+>>>>>>> origin/main"," "," ```bash"," npm ci"]},{"oldStart":56,"oldLines":7,"newStart":60,"newLines":11,"lines":[" "," ## Current status"," ","+<<<<<<< HEAD"," The monorepo and directory are an initial scaffold. The [usage package](packages/usage/README.md) and local standalone preview are under development, with no public or agent surface verified. No downloadable binaries are published, and `subset.dev` deployment has not been configured. Pilot requirements and delivery plans are tracked in [SET-1: usage dashboard](https://linear.app/21n/issue/SET-1/pilot-a-reusable-usage-status-dashboard) and [SET-2: PDF annotation and review](https://linear.app/21n/issue/SET-2/pilot-reusable-pdf-annotation-and-agent-review).","+=======","+The monorepo and directory are an initial scaffold. Neither pilot is implemented, no downloadable binaries are published, and `subset.dev` deployment has not been configured. A local [M Graph macOS capture spike](native/mgraph/README.md) tests Accessibility collection and development packaging without adding a catalog availability claim. Pilot requirements and delivery plans are tracked in [SET-1: usage dashboard](https://linear.app/21n/issue/SET-1/pilot-a-reusable-usage-status-dashboard) and [SET-2: PDF annotation and review](https://linear.app/21n/issue/SET-2/pilot-reusable-pdf-annotation-and-agent-review).","+>>>>>>> origin/main"," "," ## License"," "]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/docs/architecture.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":10,"newStart":6,"newLines":14,"lines":[" "," | Layer | Current choice | Status and boundary |"," | --- | --- | --- |","+<<<<<<< HEAD"," | Workspace | npm workspaces, TypeScript, Node.js 22.12+ | Implemented scaffold. `packages/*` own reusable contracts and logic; `apps/*` own hosts. |","+=======","+| Workspace | npm workspaces, TypeScript, Node.js 22.13+ | Implemented scaffold. `packages/*` own reusable contracts and logic; `apps/*` own hosts. |","+>>>>>>> origin/main"," | Directory | Svelte 5, Vite, Tailwind CSS 4 | Implemented local static preview. `@subset/catalog` owns metadata; the directory does not own capability data or credentials. |"," | Web delivery | Static assets first; Cloudflare intended | No deployment configured. Add Workers or storage only for a concrete capability need and after a Superfunctions reuse check. |","-| Reusable capability | `packages/<capability>/` | Planned. Domain operations, source adapters, typed inputs/outputs, and web view contracts belong here; a host wires auth, persistence, routes, and telemetry. |","+| Reusable capability | `packages/<capability>/` | Private `@subset/mgraph-contracts` defines versioned M Graph data and IPC schemas. Private `@subset/mgraph-store` owns local SQLite observations, evidence, search, and the restart-safe processing queue. The SET-7 service host, source adapters, and views remain planned; a host wires auth, permissions, routing, and telemetry. |"," | Native delivery | Swift and platform APIs when required | Planned. Native permissions and views stay in native targets; share a stable data/operation contract where useful. |"," | Agent delivery | Structured result, optional registered view; separate local CLI/skill | Planned. Each host and the published CLI/skill require their own verification. |"," "]},{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":4,"newStart":27,"newLines":4,"lines":[" 4. For PDF review, compare browser and SwiftUI/PDFKit behavior against the existing POC, then choose the first standalone surface based on annotation fidelity, file access, export, and permissions. Do not transfer POC code without an audit."," 5. Keep catalog `availableSurfaces` empty until the actual artifact and route pass release checks. A published CLI/skill and a hosted agent view are separate claims. A localhost browser page is not an embedded agent view."," ","-The CI scaffold runs workspace checks and builds. Capability tests, browser behavior, provider data, native permissions, external host integration, Cloudflare deployment, and release artifacts need their own checks when those surfaces exist.","+The CI scaffold runs workspace checks and builds. M Graph contract and local store tests run through `npm run check`; they cover schema validation, provenance, IPC v1/v2 compatibility, SQLite migrations, writer ownership, queue replay, revision fencing, search, and source retirement. Browser behavior, provider data, native permissions, external host integration, Cloudflare deployment, and release artifacts need their own checks when those surfaces exist."]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/.gitignore","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":3,"lines":["+.build/","+dist/","+__pycache__/"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Info.plist","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":16,"lines":["+<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","+<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">","+<plist version=\"1.0\"><dict>","+  <key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key><string>en</string>","+  <key>CFBundleExecutable</key><string>MGraphCapture</string>","+  <key>CFBundleIconFile</key><string>AppIcon.icns</string>","+  <key>CFBundleIdentifier</key><string>dev.subset.mgraph.capture</string>","+  <key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key><string>6.0</string>","+  <key>CFBundleName</key><string>M Graph Capture</string>","+  <key>CFBundlePackageType</key><string>APPL</string>","+  <key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key><string>0.1.0</string>","+  <key>CFBundleVersion</key><string>1</string>","+  <key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key><string>14.0</string>","+  <key>LSUIElement</key><true/>","+  <key>NSAccessibilityUsageDescription</key><string>Read text from the foreground app when you choose Capture Foreground or explicitly run the capture command.</string>","+</dict></plist>"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Package.swift","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":13,"lines":["+// swift-tools-version: 6.0","+import PackageDescription","+","+let package = Package(","+    name: \"MGraphCapture\",","+    platforms: [.macOS(.v14)],","+    products: [.executable(name: \"MGraphCapture\", targets: [\"MGraphCapture\"])],","+    targets: [","+        .target(name: \"CaptureCore\", path: \"Sources/CaptureCore\"),","+        .executableTarget(name: \"MGraphCapture\", dependencies: [\"CaptureCore\"], path: \"Sources/MGraphCapture\"),","+        .testTarget(name: \"CaptureCoreTests\", dependencies: [\"CaptureCore\"], path: \"Tests/CaptureCoreTests\")","+    ]","+)"]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":33,"changedFiles":["/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/README.md","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/docs/architecture.md","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/.gitignore","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/AppIcon.icns","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Info.plist","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Package.swift","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/README.md","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Sources/CaptureCore/CaptureCollector.swift","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Sources/MGraphCapture/main.swift","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/Tests/CaptureCoreTests/CaptureCoreTests.swift","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/build-app.sh","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/bundle_process.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/check-lifetime.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/check-menu.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/check-native.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/desktop_session.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/fixture-matrix.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/fixture_windows.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/test_bundle_process.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/test_capture_boundaries.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/test_desktop_session.py","/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/subset/native/mgraph/test_integration_preflight.py","/Users/serro/D